{"v":1,"accession":"PRJNA1234351","title":"Study on microbial community diversity composition profile","description":"Sludge samples were collected at 0 d, 20 d, and 90 d to analyze microbial community structure changes in different reactors over time. This analysis aimed to further investigate the effects of zero-valent iron (ZVI) and tetracyclines (TCs) on potential hosts of ARGs in wastewater treatment. High-throughput sequencing was used to examine microbial community composition. Specifically, zd, C20d, Fe20d, TC20d, and TCFe20d represent the initial sludge, the control group, Fe group, TCs group, and TCs+Fe group at 20 d, respectively. Similarly, C90d, Fe90d, TC90d, and TCFe90d correspond to the control group, Fe group, TCs group, and TCs+Fe group at 90 d.","center":"no","data_type":"Raw sequence reads","submission_date":"2025/03/11 00:00","sample_cols":["accession","title","tier","context","collection_date","collection_year","country","region","place_id","place","location_status","lat","lon","submitted_location","isolation_source","env_broad_scale","env_local_scale","env_medium","eligibility_reason"],"samples":[["SAMN47295961","MIMARKS Survey related sample from sludge metagenome","probable_urban","municipal_wastewater",null,2024,"CN","Shanghai",1796236,"Shanghai","verified",31.2304,121.4737,"China:Shanghai",null,"sludge","Active sludge","Active sludge","city-level location without sample-site confirmation"],["SAMN47295962","MIMARKS Survey related sample from sludge metagenome","probable_urban","municipal_wastewater",null,2024,"CN","Shanghai",1796236,"Shanghai","verified",31.2304,121.4737,"China:Shanghai",null,"sludge","Active sludge","Active sludge","city-level location without sample-site confirmation"],["SAMN47295963","MIMARKS Survey related sample from sludge metagenome","probable_urban","municipal_wastewater",null,2024,"CN","Shanghai",1796236,"Shanghai","verified",31.2304,121.4737,"China:Shanghai",null,"sludge","Active sludge","Active sludge","city-level